        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Ji and the rest had died on Yi Tian Mountain. They were able to revive mostly because of fate Gu’s destruction, and also due to this formation. When the formation stops, light fades and Wu Ji wakes with a pale expression. Wu Zhen Zhu says this is the fifth time this month. Wu Ji answers that even if she dies, she can revive. Wu Zhen Zhu tells her that the method has less and less effect as a person uses it continuously.",
      "chapters": [
        2096
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
